        <object placeholders="1" c4Name="Interface Implementation" c4Type="Note" c4Description="🟠 INTERFACE IMPL: Trading services implement standard gRPC contracts&#10;🔵 DOMAIN LOGIC: Trading-specific business logic and connectors&#10;🔴 RISK MGMT: Trading-specific risk controls and emergency stops&#10;🟣 API/MONITORING: Trading-specific UI and audit requirements&#10;🟢 SHARED SERVICES: Use generic platform services via standard APIs&#10;▪️ All external interactions through standardized interfaces&#10;▪️ Domain logic isolated from platform concerns" label="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;%c4Name%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px&quot;&gt;%c4Description%&lt;/div&gt;" id="implementation-note">
