        <object placeholders="1" c4Name="Deployment Isolation" c4Type="Note" c4Description="• This entire boundary deploys as trading domain&#10;• Shared services remain platform-deployed&#10;• Interface implementations are domain-specific&#10;• Risk controls are trading business rules&#10;• API layer serves trading-specific needs&#10;• All components scale independently" label="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;%c4Name%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 10px&quot;&gt;%c4Description%&lt;/div&gt;" id="deployment-note">
